{"step_index":52,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T13:04:33Z","thinking":"**Crafting the Animation Script**\n\nI'm currently focused on the Python script for Manim. My goal is to visualize heat transfer. I'm imagining a solid wall with warm air on one side and cold air on the other. I plan to animate heat arrows, showing their movement and changes in color/speed to represent convection and conduction effects. I've begun writing the script to `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gem`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"from manim import *\\n\\nclass HeatTransfer(Scene):\\n    def construct(self):\\n        # 1. Setup the Scene (Wall and Text)\\n        wall = Rectangle(width=2, height=6, color=BLUE, fill_opacity=0.3)\\n        self.play(Create(wall))\\n        \\n        title = Text(\\\"Heat Transfer: Convection & Conduction\\\", font_size=36)\\n        title.to_edge(UP)\\n        self.play(Write(title))\\n\\n        inside_text = Text(\\\"Inside Air\\\\n(Warm)\\\", font_size=24, color=RED).move_to(LEFT * 4 + UP * 2)\\n        outside_text = Text(\\\"Outside Air\\\\n(Cold)\\\", font_size=24, color=BLUE).move_to(RIGHT * 4 + UP * 2)\\n        wall_text = Text(\\\"Glass Wall\\\\n(Solid)\\\", font_size=24, color=WHITE).move_to(UP * 2)\\n        \\n        self.play(FadeIn(inside_text), FadeIn(outside_text), FadeIn(wall_text))\\n\\n        # 2. Animate Heat hitting the wall (Inside Convection)\\n        heat_arrows_in = VGroup(*[\\n            Arrow(start=LEFT * 5 + UP * y, end=LEFT * 1 + UP * y, color=RED, buff=0.1)\\n            for y in [-2, 0, 1]\\n        ])\\n        \\n        self.play(GrowArrow(heat_arrows_in[0]), GrowArrow(heat_arrows_in[1]), GrowArrow(heat_arrows_in[2]), run_time=1.5)\\n        \\n        conv_text1 = Text(\\\"Convection (h_i)\\\", font_size=20, color=YELLOW).next_to(heat_arrows_in, DOWN)\\n        self.play(Write(conv_text1))\\n        \\n        # 3. Animate Heat moving through the solid (Conduction)\\n        heat_arrows_mid = VGroup(*[\\n            Arrow(start=LEFT * 1 + UP * y, end=RIGHT * 1 + UP * y, color=ORANGE, buff=0.1)\\n            for y in [-2, 0, 1]\\n        ])\\n        \\n        self.play(GrowArrow(heat_arrows_mid[0]), GrowArrow(heat_arrows_mid[1]), GrowArrow(heat_arrows_mid[2]), run_time=2)\\n        \\n        cond_text = Text(\\\"Conduction (k)\\\", font_size=20, color=YELLOW).next_to(wall, DOWN)\\n        self.play(Write(cond_text))\\n\\n        # 4. Animate Heat jumping out (Outside Convection)\\n        heat_arrows_out = VGroup(*[\\n            Arrow(start=RIGHT * 1 + UP * y, end=RIGHT * 5 + UP * y, color=BLUE_C, buff=0.1)\\n            for y in [-2,\n<truncated 391 bytes>","Description":"\"Manim animation script for Heat Transfer\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\renu5\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\4f46c5d7-aaf4-4f5d-a8ca-eac2a671a001\\\\scratch\\\\heat_animation.py\"","toolAction":"\"Writing Manim python script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write manim script\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
